                    coach_header:           `Facilitator (CFO & business-unit leader)`,
                    coach_intro:            `You have five years of survey, performance and staffing data and zero interventions ever designed from it. Leadership wants you to ‘fix engagement’ — but the right analytics question almost certainly points somewhere narrower. The popular retention bonus is my biggest line item and buys a pause, not a fix. I fund decisions with returns, not dashboards. Find where you actually lose your best people, choose the one intervention that causes retention, prove it with a measurement design, and bring me an R$ number I can defend to the board.`,

                    insight_label:          `Insight Quality`,
                    insight_sub:            `Right question vs vague dashboard (0–100)`,
                    causal_label:           `Causal Confidence`,
                    causal_sub:             `Cause vs correlation, measured (0–100)`,
